OL,3,AManchester Arena survivor says 'I
OL,4,Athought life was over' on UK's first
OL,5,Anational day for terror victims
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday is the UK's first national day
OL,8,Ffor those impacted by terrorism,
OL,9,Fincluding survivors and their families,
OL,10,Fwitnesses and the emergency services
OL,12,FThere will be a ceremony, including
OL,13,Freadings from people affected by terror
OL,14,Fand a two-minute silence, in London
OL,15,Fthis afternoon - you'll be able to
OL,16,Fwatch live above
OL,18,FAn art installation, made of 1,000
OL,19,Fpaper cranes, has been set up at the
OL,20,Fceremony
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
